    "FOUND A WORKING UNAUTH FEED. The full FANTASY_CLASSIC player pool is https://play.fifa.com/json/fantasy/players.json -> 1481 players, HTTP 200 application/json, parsed OK. Saved raw to data/raw/2026-06-05/fantasy_players_raw.json.",
    "CAUTION: there is a SEPARATE feed at https://play.fifa.com/json/players.json (NO /fantasy/) returning a DIFFERENT 736-player set with a different schema (uses 'cost', 'optaId', 'matchDayPoints', 'feedId') - that belongs to another play.fifa.com game (Dream Eleven / Fantasy Daily), NOT the classic Fantasy game. Use the /fantasy/ path.",
